      "statement": "Shutdown is signal-driven and ordered: ListenAndServe runs in a goroutine, main blocks on SIGINT/SIGTERM, the HTTP server is given a 5-second shutdown context, and deferred calls then close the Postgres pool, the Ristretto cache, cancel the Vault renewal context, and flush the tracer provider.",
