      "id": "claim_cf8f84cf0d604bc7be1b2366565a5a20",
      "statement": "The SecureKeyUseCase interface defines the key lifecycle boundary (Create, Update, Read, FindByPath, ListSubkeys, DeleteKey, DeleteByPath) and is the only key-management contract the driving adapter depends on.",
