    {
      "id": "claim_7f25a677995d45deb7c33fc62a797484",
      "statement": "Authentication caches Argon2id credential hashes and policy under the \"auth_creds_\"+username key, deduplicates concurrent misses with singleflight, never caches database errors, and returns a generic \"authentication failed\" error so callers cannot distinguish wrong password from unknown user; a non-positive TTL falls back to DefaultAuthCacheTTL of 5 minutes.",
