      "id": "claim_6881729589d84f55b7ee229aa2e39ade",
      "statement": "Cache invalidation is conservative and never fails a successful mutation: Update and DeleteKey delete the single path+\"::\"+key entry after the storage write succeeds, DeleteByPath clears the entire cache because CachePort has no prefix deletion, and Create writes no cache entry.",
